  <prompt>Add a priority glyph (Fluent v9 colored dot/flag) and an effort indicator to KanbanCard in @spaarke/smart-todo-components, reading the new sprk_priority/sprk_effort choice fields (created in task 010). Extend the existing PriorityScoreCard/EffortScoreCard components (post-hoist, now living in the peer package per task 003) rather than creating new card components.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in Fluent UI v9 React components, semantic-token theming, and ADR-012 shared-library boundaries. Follow ADR-021 (semantic tokens, dark mode) strictly.</role>

  <goal>KanbanCard renders a priority glyph + effort indicator derived from sprk_priority/sprk_effort on every card; PriorityScoreCard and EffortScoreCard (hoisted into @spaarke/smart-todo-components by task 003) are extended, not duplicated; zero hex/rgb literals; light/dark parity verified.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-02 ("Card renders a priority glyph") and FR-03 ("mapping is the single source of truth...card shows the priority indicator" per Success Criteria #2). Task 003 (Phase 1) hoists the 13-file rich Kanban subtree — including PriorityScoreCard.tsx and EffortScoreCard.tsx, currently at src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/components/SmartToDo/ — into @spaarke/smart-todo-components, following the same one-folder-per-component convention already used by the partially-hoisted KanbanCard (src/client/shared/Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/components/KanbanCard/). By the time this task runs, PriorityScoreCard/EffortScoreCard are expected at src/client/shared/Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/components/PriorityScoreCard/ and .../EffortScoreCard/ respectively — verify the exact post-hoist path via Grep before editing (do not assume; task 003's actual output governs).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/components/KanbanCard/KanbanCard.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/components/KanbanCard/KanbanCard.styles.ts</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/components/PriorityScoreCard/ (post-hoist path — verify via Grep after task 003)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/components/EffortScoreCard/ (post-hoist path — verify via Grep after task 003)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/utils/todoScoring.ts</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/types/kanban.ts</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="003" status="pending">Converts LegalWorkspace SmartToDo/ to a thin shim; hoists PriorityScoreCard/EffortScoreCard into @spaarke/smart-todo-components — this task's target files depend on that landing first.</dependency>
      <dependency task="010" status="pending">sprk_priority + sprk_effort Choice columns must exist on sprk_todo before the card can read them.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Fluent v9 semantic tokens exclusively for all new glyph/indicator styling — zero hex/rgb literals, zero inline color outside the existing data-driven exceptions already documented in KanbanCard.tsx (e.g. score-circle color, due-badge color).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Extend existing components in @spaarke/smart-todo-components; no reach-into src/solutions/... (host-agnostic boundary, NFR-05).</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec">MUST NOT change the composite score formula/weights in todoScoring.ts — this task is presentation-only.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Priority/effort glyph is read-only display on the card (selection/edit happens via the form/wizard from task 011) — do not add write/edit affordances to KanbanCard itself.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
